# Build-time generated secrets (use BuildSecrets.swift.example as template).
# Path-independent on purpose: the old `Loci/Configuration/BuildSecrets.swift`
# slipped past a single hardcoded path after the Loci -> Lociate rename and got
# committed (US-210).
**/Configuration/BuildSecrets.swift

